      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The weight of feeling betrayed by the system is crushing, and it's easy to feel like your efforts are meaningless when the powerful seem untouchable. But even when the whole structure feels broken, your own internal strength is still there, and that is something worth holding onto. A therapist can help you find small ways to rebuild your sense of self and agency, even when the outside world feels overwhelmingly unfair. Please consider reaching out to someone who can help you navigate this despair.",
