      "content": "strength? what kind of strength is that? just enough strength to keep suffering through another day of knowing how corrupt everything is. it doesn't feel like a \"challenge to overcome,\" it just feels like a death sentence. when you see the truth, you can't unsee it, and now everything just feels heavy and empty. like there's no real way to go back to how things were or even find a way forward that isn't just more of the same. it's like the only honest thing left to do is just stop participating.",
